      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET\r\n\r\nLarge 5-Bedroom Two-Storey Residence with Office – Centrally Located in Frenchpark Village\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers proudly present to the market this substantial five-bedroom two-storey residence with home office, ideally situated right in the heart of Frenchpark Village.\r\n\r\nThis impressive home offers excellent living space throughout, with the added bonus of full head height in the loft, ideal for future conversion and dual access to the rear garden via electric gates. The property provides superb potential for both family living and home-based business use.\r\n\r\nImportantly, this property qualifies for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, making it an ideal opportunity for anyone looking to modernise and create their dream home while availing of available government supports.\r\n---\r\nLocation Highlights\r\n\r\nPrime setting within walking distance of all Frenchpark village amenities, including shops, national school, church, GAA facilities, and local services.\r\n\r\nJust 10 minutes from Castlerea and Ballaghaderreen, and centrally positioned only 40 minutes from both Roscommon Town and Sligo.\r\n\r\nExcellent connectivity via the N5 and N61 routes, ideal for commuters or families seeking a central base.\r\n\r\nNearby secondary schools in Ballaghaderreen and Castlerea with daily bus links.\r\n\r\nWithin a short drive to scenic walking trails, Lough Gara, and the Rathcroghan Heritage area.\r\n---\r\nAccommodation Includes\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: Tiled floor, bright and welcoming.\r\n\r\nKitchen: Fully fitted with tiled floor, tiled ceiling, and tiled splashback between units. Double French doors to dining area.\r\n\r\nDining Room: Timber flooring and ceiling with skylight, double French doors to large enclosed rear garden.\r\n\r\nLiving Room: Fitted carpet, centre light, curtains, electric heater.\r\n\r\nSitting Room: Timber flooring, solid fuel stove – ideal for cosy evenings.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bedroom: Fitted carpet, wardrobe.\r\n\r\nEnsuite: Tiled floor, WC, WHB, walk-in electric shower, skylight, storage unit.\r\n\r\nUtility Room: Tiled floor, plumbed for appliances, PVC door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding: Fitted carpet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: Timber flooring, timber ceiling, WC.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: Timber flooring, timber ceiling.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: Timber flooring, feature high ceiling offering extra light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: Large double room with fitted carpet, curtains, and high ceiling for added natural light.\r\n\r\nEnsuite: WC, WHB, pumped shower.\r\n\r\nOffice: Ideal for working from home, fitted carpet.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: White suite, tiled floor and half-tiled walls, electric shower, fully tiled around shower area.\r\n---\r\nGeneral Features\r\n\r\nQualifies for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant\r\n\r\nOak fitted doors on ground floor\r\n\r\nOil-Fired Central Heating System\r\n\r\nPVC windows and doors\r\n\r\nMains water and sewage\r\n\r\nFull head height attic with Stira stairs (ready for development)\r\n\r\nConcrete driveway to side and rear\r\n\r\nLarge enclosed rear garden with mature trees and shrubbery for privacy\r\n\r\nElectric rear gates for vehicular access\r\n\r\nLarge fuel and storage shed\r\n---\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to acquire a spacious and adaptable family home in a highly convenient village setting. The property has benefited from works over the years but will benefit from some modernisation, offering excellent scope to further enhance and personalise, ideal for those seeking to utilise the Vacant Property Grant to bring a home back to life.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended by the sole agents.\r\nStrictly by appointment only.\r\n\r\nContact:\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers, MIPAV MMCEPI\r\nPhone: 086 2130723 | 094 9362216\r\n\r\n“Everything we touch turns to SOLD.”\r\nOffices Roscommon & Mayo.\r\nLicence no 002031\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: These particulars, including measurements, floor areas and property size, are for guidance only and may contain errors. They are not part of any contract. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided"
      },
